WEBVTT

00:00:07.720 --> 00:00:09.690
Light and Darkness.

00:00:09.690 --> 00:00:12.540
The final battle of the gods
climaxed in a clash between...

00:00:12.540 --> 00:00:17.750
Marfa, Goddess of All Creation,
and Kardis, Goddess of Destruction.

00:00:18.400 --> 00:00:22.550
At the end of their fierce
battle, the stricken goddesses...

00:00:22.550 --> 00:00:27.150
had split the continent,
forming a new land.

00:00:28.090 --> 00:00:31.570
Since then, people have come
to call this new continent...

00:00:31.570 --> 00:00:36.010
"Lodoss - The Accursed Island."

00:02:10.680 --> 00:02:14.860
Fire Dragon Mountain. Home of
the foul fire dragon Shooting Star.

00:02:15.790 --> 00:02:19.710
So as to be part of the
dragon quest...

00:02:19.710 --> 00:02:22.040
Parn has joined Kashue's party.

00:02:23.120 --> 00:02:24.770
Think it'll rain?

00:02:24.770 --> 00:02:26.680
I sure hope so.

00:02:43.570 --> 00:02:44.530
It's him!

00:02:44.530 --> 00:02:45.560
Here he comes!

00:02:45.830 --> 00:02:47.060
Fire!

00:02:57.490 --> 00:02:59.030
Where the devil
were our sentries!

00:03:12.030 --> 00:03:13.000
Here he comes!

00:03:39.890 --> 00:03:41.590
Damn that...!

00:03:45.430 --> 00:03:46.200
Parn!

00:03:47.170 --> 00:03:49.200
Wait! It's too
dangerous to go out!

00:04:23.610 --> 00:04:24.790
Parn!

00:04:32.310 --> 00:04:33.240
Parn.

00:05:17.760 --> 00:05:18.940
Wait!

00:05:19.540 --> 00:05:22.450
We're only after the
Scepter of Domination, right?

00:05:22.450 --> 00:05:27.550
And it will be mine once
I defeat the Ancient Dragon.

00:05:27.860 --> 00:05:29.050
You mean...?!

00:05:29.380 --> 00:05:33.010
This sword calls out
for the beast's blood!

00:05:33.010 --> 00:05:37.450
And for that, you will first
need to possess the Scepter.

00:05:37.450 --> 00:05:39.580
You doubt my abilities?

00:05:39.580 --> 00:05:40.520
But...!

00:05:40.860 --> 00:05:41.620
Stand aside!

00:05:41.620 --> 00:05:46.050
Only foolish humans or goblins
embark on hopeless battles.

00:05:46.050 --> 00:05:47.060
"Hopeless...?"

00:05:47.060 --> 00:05:49.950
Don't underestimate the
might of an Ancient Dragon!

00:05:53.450 --> 00:05:56.910
A scratch can grow
into a fatal wound.

00:05:56.910 --> 00:05:59.460
One who dwells in Marmo
would do well to remember that.

00:06:46.540 --> 00:06:47.470
Parn!

00:06:54.480 --> 00:06:56.560
Recklessness isn't a virtue.

00:06:58.080 --> 00:07:01.270
Well, maybe it is in your case.

00:07:02.110 --> 00:07:06.690
Anyway, I can't shake the feeling
that thing was only toying with us.

00:07:08.430 --> 00:07:11.660
Like we're just worms to it!

00:07:11.660 --> 00:07:14.040
Worms have lives, too.

00:07:14.660 --> 00:07:18.540
A person's life... A worm's life...
There is no difference.

00:07:19.100 --> 00:07:21.010
Life is life!

00:07:22.340 --> 00:07:23.880
Deed.

00:07:50.140 --> 00:07:52.940
You allowed the
High Elf to escape?

00:07:52.940 --> 00:07:54.320
Forgive me, my lord.

00:07:54.320 --> 00:07:56.440
And what of Pirotess?

00:07:56.440 --> 00:07:57.790
Well, she's...

00:07:58.160 --> 00:08:00.030
Gone to Fire Dragon Mountain?

00:08:00.030 --> 00:08:03.120
Dark Elf in name,
but a woman all the same.

00:08:03.120 --> 00:08:08.050
And you have the
gall to return here?

00:08:10.200 --> 00:08:16.060
Baylos, almighty power of
fiery destruction, come forth!

00:08:16.060 --> 00:08:19.210
Baylos, almighty power of
fiery destruction...

00:08:19.210 --> 00:08:20.590
Lord Wagnard...!

00:08:23.450 --> 00:08:28.520
So, the Scepter of Domination
will come before the High Elf.

00:08:30.070 --> 00:08:31.520
The "Dragon's Path?"

00:08:31.520 --> 00:08:33.910
It sounds like an old legend.

00:08:33.910 --> 00:08:38.820
Yes. In Flaim we have the ancient
legend of the Dragon Slayer.

00:08:38.820 --> 00:08:42.360
At the end of the path supposedly
lies the dragon's fortress.

00:08:42.360 --> 00:08:43.970
I getcha.

00:08:43.970 --> 00:08:47.500
It's a back door right into
Shooting Star's lair, right Shadam?

00:08:47.500 --> 00:08:48.880
Exactly.

00:08:48.880 --> 00:08:53.340
In the past, many young warriors
dreamed of being the Dragon Slayer.

00:08:53.340 --> 00:08:56.010
But none ever returned.

00:08:56.010 --> 00:08:57.530
A gamble.

00:08:57.530 --> 00:09:03.230
Quite, but I see no other way.
What do you all think?

00:09:03.230 --> 00:09:04.350
It's risky.

00:09:04.350 --> 00:09:08.520
Most certainly risky,
but not suicidal.

00:09:09.520 --> 00:09:12.530
There's another
part of the legend.

00:09:17.580 --> 00:09:22.040
Three lances possessed by Myrii,
the god of war.

00:09:22.310 --> 00:09:25.760
They'll help us to
seal the dragon's evil.

00:09:28.390 --> 00:09:32.740
The priests are forging the
lances of Myrii as we speak.

00:09:32.740 --> 00:09:36.010
Right, we'll set out
as soon as they've finished.

00:09:36.970 --> 00:09:39.970
King Kashue,
take me with you!

00:09:42.750 --> 00:09:44.720
You want so badly to go?!

00:09:44.720 --> 00:09:45.470
Yes, sir!

00:09:45.470 --> 00:09:46.280
One condition.

00:09:46.280 --> 00:09:48.990
No reckless
heroics like before.

00:09:48.990 --> 00:09:51.480
Will you follow my orders?

00:09:54.880 --> 00:09:55.990
Yes, majesty!

00:10:06.370 --> 00:10:10.920
Slayn, I fear the situation
is worse than I imagined.

00:10:11.760 --> 00:10:13.930
Then, Lodoss...

00:10:13.930 --> 00:10:15.550
Faces a grave ordeal.

00:10:15.550 --> 00:10:16.660
Mother.

00:10:16.660 --> 00:10:19.340
Your powers
will be necessary.

00:10:19.680 --> 00:10:21.270
If I can be at all helpful...

00:10:21.270 --> 00:10:23.120
I shall help as well.

00:10:23.120 --> 00:10:24.150
Leylia.

00:10:25.850 --> 00:10:28.850
Slayn, take care of her.

00:10:43.860 --> 00:10:46.330
Marfa.
Give us strength.

00:11:44.840 --> 00:11:46.120
Now is the time.

00:11:49.670 --> 00:11:51.380
Take me with you.

00:11:51.380 --> 00:11:54.010
And if you get in my way?

00:11:55.720 --> 00:11:57.190
Then kill me.

00:12:01.640 --> 00:12:03.410
As you wish.

00:12:04.470 --> 00:12:05.530
Let's go!

00:12:39.060 --> 00:12:41.550
So, this is the Dragon's Path.

00:12:47.740 --> 00:12:49.600
Highness, take this.

00:12:53.580 --> 00:12:55.340
Believing Myrii's divine protection
and in your own power...

00:12:55.340 --> 00:12:58.620
may you bury yourself
into the creature's heart.

00:12:58.620 --> 00:13:00.750
The wound you inflict
will be surely harsh.

00:13:03.220 --> 00:13:05.760
Shadam,
I leave the rest to you.

00:13:09.080 --> 00:13:11.190
Grant him a safe return.

00:13:24.260 --> 00:13:25.160
Let's go!

00:13:36.620 --> 00:13:38.470
It splits off.

00:13:38.470 --> 00:13:39.090
I'll check it out.

00:13:39.090 --> 00:13:40.130
Wait!

00:13:49.840 --> 00:13:54.220
Remember, the obvious path
is often the wrong one.

00:13:54.620 --> 00:13:56.260
Meaning we go this way.

00:14:02.550 --> 00:14:04.660
Don't touch it!
You'll be burned!

00:14:05.820 --> 00:14:06.840
Shirts!

00:14:08.730 --> 00:14:10.360
Sylph, spirit of wind.

00:14:10.360 --> 00:14:12.750
Let thy winds shield us
from the flames.

00:14:12.750 --> 00:14:14.330
Sylph, spirit of wind.

00:14:14.330 --> 00:14:16.330
Let thy winds shield us
from the flames.

00:14:16.950 --> 00:14:18.210
Quickly now!

00:14:24.150 --> 00:14:24.760
Deed!

00:14:44.290 --> 00:14:47.610
Run! Don't even think
of trying to fight it!

00:15:10.420 --> 00:15:11.460
What in...?

00:15:42.280 --> 00:15:43.450
Wait!

00:15:46.770 --> 00:15:53.670
Divine power, buried since
ancient times, reveal thyself...

00:16:15.320 --> 00:16:16.990
It must be... Highness!

00:16:32.930 --> 00:16:34.140
Here.

00:16:34.140 --> 00:16:36.510
I can feel the
beast's bloodlust.

00:16:37.490 --> 00:16:39.050
What's wrong, Deed?

00:16:39.050 --> 00:16:40.520
Someone's here!

00:16:47.530 --> 00:16:51.530
An odd place to meet,
is it not, Mercenary King?

00:16:57.530 --> 00:16:58.800
Ashram!

00:16:59.830 --> 00:17:01.750
Ashram! You devil!

00:17:01.750 --> 00:17:02.760
Wait!

00:17:04.000 --> 00:17:06.020
The little whelp from before.

00:17:06.020 --> 00:17:07.640
What are you up to?!

00:17:08.510 --> 00:17:12.210
What if I said it was
the possession of Lodoss?

00:17:12.210 --> 00:17:13.700
What?!

00:17:13.700 --> 00:17:16.200
Would you be so kind
as to come to <i>me</i> this time?

00:17:16.200 --> 00:17:17.260
You!

00:17:41.030 --> 00:17:42.620
You've improved.

00:17:45.700 --> 00:17:49.150
I think you said something
about a sword not being a toy!

00:18:10.650 --> 00:18:12.660
But still so easy.

00:18:35.530 --> 00:18:36.840
Lord Ashram!

00:18:37.670 --> 00:18:38.840
The fire...?!

00:18:40.260 --> 00:18:45.850
I see. The Scepter of Domination
controls the dragon as well!

00:18:49.370 --> 00:18:50.250
That's...!

00:18:50.250 --> 00:18:52.360
The Scepter of Domination!

00:18:52.360 --> 00:18:53.360
Impossible!

00:18:53.360 --> 00:18:56.110
Parn, we can't let
the Marmo have that!

00:18:56.400 --> 00:18:57.610
What?!

00:19:09.960 --> 00:19:12.630
The Dragon Slayer, eh?

00:19:28.240 --> 00:19:30.640
I shall be the one
to bring the beast down!

00:19:36.990 --> 00:19:37.870
Stand aside!

00:19:37.870 --> 00:19:39.400
No! It's impossible!

00:19:57.880 --> 00:20:01.300
The Scepter of
Domination is ours!

00:20:19.720 --> 00:20:21.040
Let's do it, Parn!

00:20:21.040 --> 00:20:21.700
Right!

00:20:27.200 --> 00:20:28.540
It's too dangerous!

00:20:29.250 --> 00:20:31.260
Sylph, protect him!

00:21:09.420 --> 00:21:13.030
For... the conquest... of Lodoss...

00:21:16.510 --> 00:21:18.080
Pirotess...!!!

00:21:33.900 --> 00:21:35.350
We have to get out of here!

00:21:50.110 --> 00:21:51.330
Parn, hurry!

00:22:20.080 --> 00:22:24.760
First encountered amidst flame,
Ashram disappears amidst flame.

00:22:25.500 --> 00:22:28.510
Their meetings
were marked more...

00:22:28.510 --> 00:22:31.070
by the crossing swords
than by the exchange of words.

00:22:31.070 --> 00:22:37.080
Yet Ashram's silent death has
engraved itself upon Parn's heart.

00:22:53.230 --> 00:22:56.750
On the masterless island,
an ominous air now pervades.

00:22:56.750 --> 00:22:58.310
With the Scepter of Domination
now in his possession...

00:22:58.650 --> 00:23:03.410
the Marmo wizard Wagnard now
moves after Deed's eternal life.

00:23:03.410 --> 00:23:06.330
The real battle may
finally be at hand!

00:23:07.060 --> 00:23:09.090
Next time,
on Record of Lodoss War:

00:23:09.090 --> 00:23:12.310
Episode 11 -
"The Wizard's Ambition"

00:23:13.190 --> 00:23:16.070
I will defend the peace
of Lodoss with my life!
